llar off on Fridays. Definitely would come back again."},{"business_id":"tjcbw-0JVLrjrEcWenio1g","review_id":"OXI7jQ8FwyZKZM03FSxkvA","date":"2013-08-14T18:12:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9288773536682129,"text_excerpt":"Great place for lunch as long as you don't mind the afternoon food coma. I had the BBQ salad with brisket and the brisket had great flavor. Not much of a crust, but still very nice. I tried it with the mustard sauce and was in heaven."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
